                        ],
                        "form": "die Dachstuben"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                        "entry_id": "ac2fde1b-1ed1-372e-af67-0723fc3c3d57",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein ausgebauter Wohnraum im Dachgeschoss"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dc6cf378-1a3c-4435-a757-efc6861ba651",
                                "sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                                "text": "Er hat von seiner Dachstube einen schönen Ausblick."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cca0671a-4c38-4420-9748-fbd91a8394d6",
                                "sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                                "text": "„Ja, hier in Hausnummer 17 hatte er einst in einer Dachstube gewohnt und war täglich an der Kneipe vorbeigegangen.“"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "795daf52-2a2b-4c54-ad0c-5fb86e752c96",
                                "sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                                "text": "„Ich zog mit meiner Familie von einer Dachstube in die nächste, von denen man jedoch nicht auf die Seine, sondern auf einige der weniger appetitlichen Straßen von Bangor herunterblickte, diejenigen, in denen die Streifenwagen der Polizei immer Samstag nachts um zwei aufzutauchen scheinen“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "8c6ab4f5-0a2d-4ca7-b552-b11f954df43e",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac2fde1b-1ed1-372e-af67-0723fc3c3d57",
                        "source_sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Architektur, Bauwesen: ein ausgebauter Wohnraum im Dachgeschoss",
                        "target_lang_word": "garret",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "garret",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4a4f6aa9-d8b8-3079-b66a-01596b234f73",
                                        "entry_id": "1cbc1a50-6b40-34fb-9e45-eade0d567e62",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An attic or semi-finished room just beneath the roof of a house."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb1ccc5c-6a8f-4f1d-92be-76b4fd46b7b4",
                                                "sense_id": "4a4f6aa9-d8b8-3079-b66a-01596b234f73",
                                                "text": "This morning (we living lately in the garret,) I rose, put on my suit with great skirts, having not lately worn any other clothes but them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0480271d-644e-466f-a297-aa9114cbb0ca",
                                                "sense_id": "4a4f6aa9-d8b8-3079-b66a-01596b234f73",
                                                "text": "On an exceptionally hot evening early in July a young man came out of the garret in which he lodged in S. Place and walked slowly, as though in hesitation, towards K. bridge."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ef60c626-2376-4de7-98fb-bb72773eb3d7",
                                                "sense_id": "4a4f6aa9-d8b8-3079-b66a-01596b234f73",
                                                "text": "I was in the main garret, with huge beams and rafters over my head, great spaces around me, a door here and there in sight, and long vistas whose gloom was thinned by a few lurking cobwebbed windows and small dusky skylights."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fd2e1031-7454-432e-8be5-ecabf9d81c88",
                                                "sense_id": "4a4f6aa9-d8b8-3079-b66a-01596b234f73",
                                                "text": "While a boon to garret-living, financially struggling young musicians, the library has caught the attention of music publishers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ccc94ef6-31ec-43bc-ae22-be0931ea7c96",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac2fde1b-1ed1-372e-af67-0723fc3c3d57",
                        "source_sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Architektur, Bauwesen: ein ausgebauter Wohnraum im Dachgeschoss",
                        "target_lang_word": "attic",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "attic",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c830d765-a0e1-357a-8432-0e5d085f0ad6",
                                        "entry_id": "3c40d324-d1c2-380c-8c2f-17913c4889aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The space, often unfinished and with sloped walls, directly below the roof in the uppermost part of a house or other building, generally used for storage or habitation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7f07a096-7dd4-4f69-9b17-beba1a3ba290",
                                                "sense_id": "c830d765-a0e1-357a-8432-0e5d085f0ad6",
                                                "text": "We went up to the attic to look for the boxes containing our childhood keepsakes."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "562aa7cc-fe10-4c4d-9416-b4fae5d063fa",
                                                "sense_id": "c830d765-a0e1-357a-8432-0e5d085f0ad6",
                                                "text": "In my Wonderland, I'm back on my Alice\nBack in my palace, I'm fly like Aladdin\nServing my fans all my dope, 'cause they addicts\nHaters mad 'cause I'm on top like an attic\nAnd if it's beef then we're shooting sporadic\nGame is like Disney, my words are like magic"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9cdda21d-95bc-3b47-bf0b-5f06f3288e61",
                                        "entry_id": "3c40d324-d1c2-380c-8c2f-17913c4889aa",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person's head or brain."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e13a86f-ca29-4670-9197-289ef4f0fa96",
                                                "sense_id": "9cdda21d-95bc-3b47-bf0b-5f06f3288e61",
                                                "text": "[…] was a diminutive, forked-radish sort of a young man, very fashionably attired, or, as he would say, kiddily togg'd; and, though it was scarcely noon, he was rather queer in the attic; that is to say, not exactly sober."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9a3def3b-928a-404e-943d-8d2a183e3d23",
                        "source_entry_id": "ac2fde1b-1ed1-372e-af67-0723fc3c3d57",
                        "source_sense_id": "2787259f-8d3d-3a39-a22a-ede2e2f4723e",
                        "source_sense_description": "Architektur, Bauwesen: ein ausgebauter Wohnraum im Dachgeschoss",
                        "target_lang_word": "pigeonnier",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "pigeonnier",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ca9c9bf-75b7-3a1a-a98a-0ef6c6886c2a",
                                        "entry_id": "4649eca8-925e-3c21-821f-8129920db15a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Construction destinée à loger les pigeons domestiques."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bbfd6977-b19d-4dd3-b578-8748806258c1",
                                                "sense_id": "9ca9c9bf-75b7-3a1a-a98a-0ef6c6886c2a",
                                                "text": "Confondu dans le pays avec le four à chanvre qui lui ressemble étrangement, le pigeonnier est souvent plus soigné dans sa construction. C'est un élément plus rare du décor architectural car il provient, pour l'essentiel, d'anciens domaines."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a88c384d-1192-4c43-b8a8-177adc57edff",
                                                "sense_id": "9ca9c9bf-75b7-3a1a-a98a-0ef6c6886c2a",
                                                "text": "Le Gers n'est certainement pas le département le plus fourni en pigeonniers mais il n'est pas rare d'en croiser au détour des petites routes de campagne et ce sur tout le territoire. Ces petites bâtisses d'ornement sont parfois surprenantes par leur forme, leur emplacement, leur décor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e796db29-b152-4fc5-aa66-cca7a69710b5",
                                                "sense_id": "9ca9c9bf-75b7-3a1a-a98a-0ef6c6886c2a",
                                                "text": "Après un contact téléphonique et une vérification nocturne dans son pigeonnier par le propriétaire, il s’est avéré qu’il lui manquait 26 pigeons de compétition."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "32cd4f3c-1a66-35fe-bbfd-9d25dab2a825",
                                        "entry_id": "4649eca8-925e-3c21-821f-8129920db15a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Habitation élevée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "familiar",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47b756fe-b941-4c25-b7f5-7a99c2d952c3",
                                                "sense_id": "32cd4f3c-1a66-35fe-bbfd-9d25dab2a825",
                                                "text": "Je le trouve ailleurs , ne vous déplaise , repartit Boisrobert: M. de Balzac ne reste confiné dans son pigeonnier depuis plus de quinze ans , que pour faire pièce à Votre Éminence."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0c49f8d9-2455-3b8f-bcd8-4db65aa4cbc6",
                                        "entry_id": "4649eca8-925e-3c21-821f-8129920db15a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Boîte aux lettres ou un système de boîtes aux lettres collectif souvent utilisé dans un milieu administratif ou scolaire."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Québec"
                                        ],
